# ai_shell.py — Tek terminalde calisan, Canli Inbrisk MCP + PowerShell agent.
# Yerel fine-tuned inbrisk-agent (1.7B) modeli milisaniyelik JSON-RPC modunda calistirir,
# Ornith / OpenAI / Ollama tool-calling modlarini destekler.
#
# Kullanim:  python ai_shell.py [--backend inbrisk-agent] [--timeout 60]

